Built on the official `vaultwarden/server` image. PostgreSQL-backed, env-driven,
read-only root filesystem, all credentials via `existingSecret`. Ingress is left
to the platform (no chart-managed Ingress by default).

## Migrating an existing deployment in place

Set `persistence.existingClaim` to your current data PVC and `fullnameOverride`
to the running resource name so the new Deployment adopts the same volume and
Service with zero data movement:

```yaml
fullnameOverride: vaultwarden
persistence:
  existingClaim: vaultwarden-data-vaultwarden-0
existingSecret: vaultwarden-secret
```

